        <div class="code">#4CC9A7</div>
    </div>

    <div class="color-card">
        <div class="swatch" style="background:#FFD66B;">
            <span class="sample-text">Warning Yellow</span>
        </div>
        <div class="code">#FFD66B</div>
    </div>

    <div class="color-card">
        <div class="swatch" style="background:#FF6B6B;">
            <span class="sample-text light">Error Coral</span>
        </div>
        <div class="code">#FF6B6B</div>
    </div>

</div>

<h2>Typography</h2>

<div class="typography-section">

    <div class="type-card">
        <div class="type-label">Heading 1</div>
        <div class="type-sample h1">If Florida potatoes are starting to grow little sprouts…</div>
    </div>

    <div class="type-card">
        <div class="type-label">Heading 2</div>
        <div class="type-sample h2">If Florida potatoes are starting to grow little sprouts…</div>
    </div>

    <div class="type-card">
        <div class="type-label">Body Text</div>
        <div class="type-sample body">
            If Florida potatoes are starting to grow little sprouts, what is the effect on them.
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
